config REKERNEL
	bool "Re:Kernel (report binder/signal events to frozen apps' freezer)"
	depends on NET && CGROUP_FREEZER
	default y
	help
	  Sends a netlink notification (units 22-25, user port 100) when a
	  frozen app receives a binder transaction, runs out of async binder
	  buffer, or is signalled. Userspace uses this to thaw the app.
	  See https://github.com/Sakion-Team/Re-Kernel
